  "description": "After losing his life and the woman he loves to a ruthless wizard, Theo Clark is resurrected as a Revenant - an undead being forced to consume essence stones, the life-giving cores embedded within all living creatures. As Theo grows stronger with every enemy he defeats, he unlocks powerful new abilities to hunt the man responsible for his tragic fate. However, as the wizard’s conquest endangers the world itself, Theo discovers that every increase in power comes with a devastating cost, forcing him to choose between his humanity and the power needed to destroy his enemies.\n\nSource: [WEBTOON](https://www.webtoons.com/en/action/revenant/list?title_no=8128)",
